title: Introduce `chill_inactive` extrinsic to the `pallet-staking-async`

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      `chill_inactive` extrinsic can be used to chill the validators that were inactive too much and can be called by anyone if the 
      validator meets the criterias for chilling.

      Validator can be chilled if if has zero era points for at least ChillInactiveThreshold (configurable) eras among the last HistoryDepth eras.  
crates:
  - name: pallet-staking-async
    bump: minor
